node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
.git
.env
.env.local
*.tsbuildinfo
# Prisma's generated client is platform-specific (native query-engine
# binaries) — regenerated fresh inside the container by `pnpm db:generate`,
# never copied in from the host. packages/contracts/src/generated (the
# committed openapi-typescript output) is NOT covered by this — different
# directory, plain generated TS, meant to be copied in as-is.
packages/db/generated
# F21: the single-server deployment builds with the repository as context
# on the server itself, where infra/vps holds live secrets, the internal CA
# key and nightly database dumps. None of it may enter an image layer.
infra/vps/.env
infra/vps/app.env
infra/vps/Caddyfile
infra/vps/certs
infra/vps/backups
infra/vps/releases.log
infra/vps/maintenance/ON
# The deployment browser suite's copy of the previous web build.
.e2e-deploy
